[cookbook:Soy Milk|soy milk]]\n* 1¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] salt\n* Freshly-ground [[cookbook:pepper|pepper]] to taste\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Pistachio sauce ===\n\n# Heat milk in a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] while stirring in pistachios until it thickens.\n# Season with salt and pepper.\n\n=== Rice ===\n\n# Cook rice with water and salt added. Add currants when almost cooked.\n# Serve in a mound on plates leaving a 1-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] border of rice around the edges\n# Top with sautéed vegetables\n# Pour over with some of the pistachio sauce.\n# [[Cookbook:Garnish|Garnish]] with chopped pistachios and currants. \n# Serve the remainder of the sauce in a gravy dish and bring to the table.\n\n[[Category:Kosher for Passover recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pistachio]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Persian Rice with Pistachio Sauce","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1½ cups basmati brown rice","sourceText":"1½ cups basmati brown rice","amountText":"1½ cups basmati brown rice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3¾ cups water","sourceText":"3¾ cups water","amountText":"3¾ cups water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1½ teaspoon salt","sourceText":"1½ teaspoon salt","amountText":"1½ teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"⅓ cup currants","sourceText":"⅓ cup currants","amountText":"⅓ cup currants","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Sautéed vegetables as required","sourceText":"Sautéed vegetables as required","amountText":"Sautéed vegetables as required","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 cup raw, unsalted ground pistachios","sourceText":"1 cup raw, unsalted ground pistachios","amountText":"1 cup raw, u